{"unit_id":"LoserFox__distill#feature-review","repo":"LoserFox/distill","commit":"78a508c8839a0cd4205c95416905d7d5e2e2775e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@loserfox/distill** 的功能「回合后反省」：在 `agent/turn-stopping` 收集检查点之后新增的人类消息；达到 `minUserMessages` 门槛后启动后台反省。同一会话同时只运行一个任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:177-195","src/index.ts:240-273","src/index.ts:366-398","src/index.ts:506-581"]}
{"unit_id":"LoserFox__distill#feature-create","repo":"LoserFox/distill","commit":"78a508c8839a0cd4205c95416905d7d5e2e2775e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@loserfox/distill** 的功能「创建技能」：反省子代理返回有效的 create 提案后，将技能名、描述和正文渲染为带 frontmatter 的 `SKILL.md`，写入配置的项目或用户技能目录；目标已存在时跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:177-195","src/index.ts:240-273","src/index.ts:366-398","src/index.ts:506-581"]}
{"unit_id":"LoserFox__distill#feature-update","repo":"LoserFox/distill","commit":"78a508c8839a0cd4205c95416905d7d5e2e2775e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**@loserfox/distill** 的功能「更新自有技能」：反省子代理可提出对已有蒸馏技能的完整替换；插件只更新含 `distilled-by: dsh-distill` 标记的目标，并可用 `allowUpdate` 关闭更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:177-195","src/index.ts:240-273","src/index.ts:366-398","src/index.ts:506-581"]}
